leGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">졸업 등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">는 근로 불가능&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">[</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">근로장학금 지급불가, 환수조치</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">]</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">★&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">부정근로로 적발되면 근로 참여&nbsp;제한 조치&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">[</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">유의사항 반드시 확인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">]</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">★&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">해외출입국 사전 신고&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacin